-- A draw as one operand of a sum: N(0, 2) + N(0, 1) = N(0, sqrt 5). The
-- sum's law is affine, with the redex one of its latents; the catch-all
-- takes the sum and the affine algebra enters the redex as the binding it
-- is. The application itself is never the catch-all's (the binding
-- resolver's engines take it), only a Gaussian built over it (task
-- gaussian-catch-all-dispatch-on-codegen-law).
p(1.5)=(0.1424652, 1.0)
p(0.0)=(0.1784124, 1.0)
cdf(0.0)=(0.5, 0.0)
cdf(2.0)=(0.8144533, 0.0)
